OL,3,GNEWSAHow people-power fought
OL,4,Aunauthorised development
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother bank holiday, another community
OL,7,Fshocked by the rapid transformation of
OL,8,Fgreen space that did not have planning
OL,9,Fpermission. However, residents in the
OL,10,Fsmall Hertfordshire town of
OL,11,FSawbridgeworth and the local council
OL,12,Ffought back. By Monday morning, the
OL,13,Fdiggers were leaving.
OL,15,FWith similar cases seemingly on the
OL,16,Frise, what did the people of
OL,17,FSawbridgeworth do to win this sudden
OL,18,Fbattle?
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
