OL,3,GNEWSAHow people-power fought
OL,4,Aunauthorised development
OL,5,
OL,6,FSawbridgeworth is a popular commuter
OL,7,Ftown near the Essex border, which made
OL,8,Fheadlines in 1999 when David and
OL,9,FVictoria Beckham bought their mansion,
OL,10,Fdubbed Beckingham Palace.
OL,12,FThe town sits on the River Stort, which
OL,13,Fruns past the field in question, just
OL,14,Foff Sheering Mill Lane.
